  "claim_ceiling": "This package records a candidate business ontology, owner-accepted BusinessMeaning and InterpretationModel semantics, and one Auth-owned L0 FormalClaim v3 candidate rebound to those accepted postimages. FormalClaim admission and current-TDE v2 projection remain pending. The package proves neither the FormalClaim, intake eligibility, an obligation, a theorem, an implementation, provider evidence, system security, resilience, release, nor production readiness.",
